### Admin order stream (SSE) and period receipt export (ZIP). Requires ADMIN.

### login admin
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/uni-book-store/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=uni-book-store-client&username=admin&password=admin

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### subscribe to the live new-order stream (SSE) — leave open, then place an order as a user
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/orders/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### export all receipts in a period as a ZIP (from/to are ISO-8601 instants)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/orders/receipts/export?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2027-01-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/zip
